pkg:Evidence_v1_51_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.51.0 (STORY-21: real TestGen log-label bug found via owner-uploaded log, fixed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: investigated a fresh owner-uploaded session log. It independently confirmed STORY-10's real parallel dispatch working correctly in production with a genuine live model, and its own raw codelab_log.json revealed a real, previously undetected bug -- agentTestGen's own log entries indistinguishable from agentCodeGen's, both logged under event:'codegen'. Traced to 3 real call sites and fixed, verified via real Playwright calls to the real functions. The same log also provided fresh, corroborating evidence for STORY-18's own prior research conclusion: a genuine live model still failed to produce a fenced code block even against STORY-17's own specific remedy, confirming the limitation is the model's own capability. Full 24-question regression suite: 24/24, 0 errors. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS (70 subjects, reproduces), register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "cf1db8c60d2b26055f44abc6d0b84e077cd418d74ce65e8f5360c2b79d32fde8"^^xsd:string .
